---
title: "supplyTokens (LegionPreLiquidOpenApplicationSale)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_auth: caller check
    q_check_auth --> q_check_results: caller is projectAdmin
    q_check_auth --> q_revert_auth: unauthorized
    q_revert_auth --> [*]: revert Unauthorized
    q_check_results --> q_check_supplied: saleResultsPublished == true
    q_check_results --> q_revert_no_results: results not published
    q_revert_no_results --> [*]: revert ResultsNotPublished
    q_check_supplied --> q_calc_total: tokensSupplied == false
    q_check_supplied --> q_revert_supplied: already supplied
    q_revert_supplied --> [*]: revert AlreadySupplied
    q_calc_total --> q_transfer: totalRequired = allocatedTokens + legionTokenFee + referrerTokenFee
    q_transfer --> q_mark: transfer totalRequired askToken from projectAdmin
    q_mark --> [*]: tokensSupplied = true, emit TokensSupplied

    note right of q_calc_total
        INV-001: token supply only after sale results publication
        INV-002: includes fee tokens for Legion and referrer
        INV-003: tokensSupplied transitions false to true exactly once
    end note
